ex:ST7_RenderCh17 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Rendered from the approved draft DRAFT_ch17_v1_0_2.md. Deck SEN0414_Ch17_PDFAndWordDocuments_3e_v2_1_0.pptx (59 slides; v2_0_0 stays): story slides for the 2008 .doc specification (31), the Word source code (40; portrait of Charles Simonyi, NASA, public domain) and the pypdf history (14; Python logo of the 1990s to 2006, public domain), built by deck_build_v2_1_0.py from deck_content_v2_1_0.py; manifest chapter_code_ch17_v1_0_1.json (28 examples, slide numbers shifted by the new slide); sen0414_ch17_stories_v1_1_0.py; page sen0414_ch17_page_v9_96_1.html made by sen0414_page_stories_patch_v1_0_0.py (only stories, chapter-code list and version differ from v9_96_0, proven by the tool). Checks run on 2026-11-11: manifest self-check PASS (28 examples re-run); deck standard check v1.0.0 PASS 13 of 13; deck overlap check CLEAN; 20 links answer 200; stories self-check 0 failures. Not clean: deck standard check v1.1.0 reports D3, D12 and M1 failing, and reports the same three on the accepted v2_0_0 deck (a later tool version that this deck era does not meet); page test 9.37.0 stopped at 70 features passed, 0 failed, when the browser tab crashed, and the accepted page v9_96_0 stops at the same place on this machine, so the remaining features of the page test are not verified here. Facts: the story pictures were read as Wikimedia thumbnails (full-size downloads refused with HTTP 429). The resources slide is unchanged (14 links); the new story links stand on their story slides. The Word lesson line is shorter than the draft's (14-word limit of the page's story check). Pictures of the 2008 story: the existing Office 2007 boxes photograph, said in the speaker notes not to show the announcement." .
